feature: google provider only reads GEMINI_API_KEY/GOOGLE_API_KEY env — cannot borrow agy (Antigravity) OAuth the way it borrows grok/codex/pi auth files. If agy exposes a usable Google credential, add an auth-file adapter for it.

Audit 2026-10-26: already fixed on current master; no new implementation needed. agy OAuth adapter exists with environment precedence, expiry handling and Bearer transport regressions; tests/test_auth_discovery.py. Inspected whole ticket, code and regressions; final combined remote suite will validate integration.